                },
                {
                  "start_index": 13,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "You caught me working on my top",
                    "secret project!"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 15,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "See, I left Silph Co. because",
                    "they wanted to mass-produce",
                    "fusion tech without understanding",
                    "it. I thought I could do better."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 18,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
                    "I'm developing a completely",
                    "artificial Pokémon — Porygon.",
                    "Made entirely from code."
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "start_index": 20,
                  "type": "text",
                  "lines": [
